  ! consumed by Pelotero.Score.scoreTeamForGame (the canonical scoring read)
  ~ called by: Pelotero.Effects.LineupSnapshot.runLineupSnapshotDB, Pelotero.DB.LineupSnapshot.getSnapshotForTeamGame

