%decision NewEffectForPhaseB3
  what:    LineupSnapshot is a separate effect from LineupSlot; the two have different lifecycles and different consumers
  why:     LineupSlot is the live, mutable, owner-edited lineup. LineupSnapshot is the immutable per-game freeze. Different concerns, different effects. Pelotero.Score reads ONLY from LineupSnapshot; Pelotero.Lineup.Snapshot writes ONLY to LineupSnapshot. Pelotero.UI / lineup management reads/writes LineupSlot. Splitting the effects keeps the producer/consumer graph clean and avoids the temptation to read from the live lineup at scoring time (which was the original correctness bug).
  affects: 


